# T14 - keep the build context small and keep secrets out of it.
#
# Anything listed here never reaches the Docker daemon, so it cannot end up in
# an image layer even by accident. Excluding node_modules also forces the image
# to install from the lockfile rather than inheriting a host install that may
# contain platform-specific binaries built for a different OS.

# Dependencies and build output - reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Version control and CI metadata
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Logs, caches and local artifacts
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm
.cache
coverage
.nyc_output
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor and local tooling directories
.vscode
.idea

# Docs and evidence that the runtime image does not need
docs
*.md
!README.md
